OL,3,GNEWSATrees to be cut as city faces
OL,4,A'serious' ash dieback
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charitable trust responsible for more
OL,7,Fthan 6,000 acres of public parks says
OL,8,Fit is facing a "serious challenge" from
OL,9,Fa fungal disease that is killing trees
OL,10,Fin the UK.
OL,12,FMilton Keynes Parks Trust will remove
OL,13,Faffected trees this autumn after they
OL,14,Fwere infected by ash dieback, which
OL,15,Fmakes them prone to collapse.
OL,17,FThe trust says the high volume of ash
OL,18,Fin the city's parks means "we are
OL,19,Fhaving to start removing some of the
OL,20,Ftrees before the disease fully takes
OL,21,Fhold".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
