OL,3,GNEWSATrees to be cut as city faces
OL,4,A'serious' ash dieback
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The Parks Trust recognises that
OL,7,Fremoving a large number of trees may
OL,8,Flook drastic, but the work is necessary
OL,9,Fto keep people safe and to protect the
OL,10,Flong-term health of the woodlands," a
OL,11,Fspokesperson said.
